    <h1 data-reveal style="transition-delay:.05s">What Does It Mean to Walk the Narrow Road Home?</h1>
    <p class="lede" data-reveal style="transition-delay:.12s">&ldquo;Small is the gate and narrow is the road that leads to life, and only a few find it.&rdquo; &mdash; Matthew 7:14</p>
    <p class="body" data-reveal style="transition-delay:0.18s">This isn&rsquo;t supposed to be a hard page. It&rsquo;s the short, honest version of what that verse means, what it costs, and how you actually get on the road &mdash; no pressure, no fine print.</p>
    <div class="nrh-pagehero-actions" data-reveal style="transition-delay:.34s"><a href="#gods-story" class="nrh-btn-gold">Read God&rsquo;s Story <span aria-hidden="true">&darr;</span></a></div>
  </div>
